<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n120\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Well, naturally, the last one is </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE>'s handwriting is so messy.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間暗い.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\ろうそくの明かり.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1,111" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... So I'm last, then."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe some of the alcohol had worn off. Her way of talking was back to normal.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... I live alone now. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">This is a story from after I started university in Tokyo, until I moved from my first room to the next one..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\東京.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "900" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\ループ東京.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1,人物1,アイテム2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―That day, I had come to Tokyo alone to look for a room to rent.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What kind of place would become my castle?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Living alone for the first time, I was excited.<PG>
A convenient place close to the station and the university.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And, as cheap as possible.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was walking all over, looking for the next real-estate agency, when...<PG>
"Say, you there, <STYLE ID="1">miss with the odd eyes</STYLE>."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Suddenly I heard a middle-aged woman's voice.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I turned toward the voice, there she was, sitting on a chair at a little table set up by the roadside.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She was a street-corner fortune-teller, the kind you might see on TV.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\ループ占い.gal" "WAIT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... Do you mean me?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Oh, odd eyes, just as I thought."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hadn't she called me odd-eyed because she'd seen my eyes?<PG>
"And a stunning beauty on top of it!
{PAUSE ""}
　Let's see, how about I take a look at <STYLE ID="1">you, miss</STYLE>?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... But I..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I don't want any money. I'm not out to push anything strange on you, either. I just got curious about <STYLE ID="1">you, miss</STYLE>. 
{PAUSE ""}
Anyway, it'll only take about 10 minutes."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Not knowing Tokyo well and not very wary, I sat down across from her as she told me to.<PG>
"Hmm..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I thought she'd use the cards on the table, but instead she was staring at my face.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... You don't use the cards?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Ah, I meant to practice card reading, but my specialty is face reading. 
{PAUSE ""}
With <STYLE ID="1">you, miss</STYLE>, I'd better look properly..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... Do I interest you that much?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But the fortune-teller didn't open her mouth for a good minute.<PG>
"―I see. 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Miss</STYLE>... never make the easy choice. 
{PAUSE ""}
And close to <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE>, there's someone who tells lies. Someone who <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="だま">deceives</STYLE> everyone with clever manipulation. 
{PAUSE ""}
It might even put your life at stake."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's quite a frightening thing to say...<PG>
"<STYLE ID="1">You</STYLE>'re an honest, straightforward person, miss, for better or worse. 
{PAUSE ""}
Whatever you do, don't let someone close to you <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="だま">deceive</STYLE> you... 
{PAUSE ""}
That's all!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The fortune-teller really did finish without taking any money.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\ループ東京.gal" "WAIT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3" RUBY="だま">Deceived</STYLE> by someone close to me...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I had come to Tokyo alone, so there was no one close to me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Still, it was only fortune-telling. I just thought I'd be careful about the people I'd meet from now on.<PG>
And I kept looking for a new place to live, and―at last I found one.
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\春の兆し.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\ループ不動産屋.gal" "WAIT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
A 10-minute walk from the university, a 10-minute walk from the station, a 5-minute walk from the supermarket.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And the rent was 20,000 yen.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I did think it was a little suspicious, but when I asked the real-estate agent,<PG>
"It's cheap because the building is 80 years old. Students these days don't want places that are too old, either... 
{PAUSE ""}
But it was renovated a little while ago, so there's heating and air conditioning, and a bathroom unit, and I don't think there's any problem living there."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
the woman helping me answered with a smile.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... Then could I take a look at it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yes, certainly."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\ループアパート外観.gal" "WAIT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The apartment building she took me to did look old from the outside.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I was used to old houses from Arata, so I didn't mind much.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Cockroaches or centipedes showing up don't rattle me, anyway.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\ループアパート部屋1.gal" "WAIT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Yes, I could live here without any problem.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Unlike the outside, the inside of the room was very clean.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She'd said it was renovated recently, too. Hadn't I come across a pretty good place?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But there was one thing that bothered me.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\ループアパート外廊下.gal" "WAIT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I couldn't see anyone who lived there.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
How should I put it... there was no sign of anyone living there.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Having grown up in the mountains like this, I'm very sensitive to the presence of living things.<PG>
But at the time, I didn't think much of it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Walking through the crowds of Tokyo had probably dulled that sense too, I figured.<PG>
I decided on this room.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The room I'd move into was Room 205.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
On either side were 204 and 206, and 206 next door was the end room on that floor.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The building's name was... 
{PAUSE ""}
'<STYLE ID="4" RUBY="しりんかん">Shirinkan</STYLE>'.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―And then, on moving day...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\ループアパート部屋3.gal" "WAIT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
With most of my things carried in, I thought I'd go greet the neighbors, and I left my room with a gift.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\ループアパート外廊下.gal" "WAIT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\ノック.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
I knocked on the door next to mine.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just because there had happened to be no sign of anyone that time didn't mean no one lived there.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
206 was vacant, so the one I knocked on was 204.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But the door didn't open, 
{PAUSE ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\ノック.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "700" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
and instead a knock came back.<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\深淵からの呼び声.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's not as if this were a toilet. Was she telling me to open it?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Was that how things were in Tokyo?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Puzzled, I opened the door myself.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The one who came out was―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\屋上ドア.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\黒茅萱.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
A woman about my age, perhaps.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But her hair was a mess, her eyes were bloodshot, her face was pale, and she was terribly thin.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just seeing her took me aback.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But what surprised me even more was...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\怖い効果音.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\ループアパート部屋2.gal" "WAIT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
that the room inside had not been renovated, and was as run-down as a <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="はいきょ">ruin</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... I-I'm Chigaya Niimura. I've just moved in next door..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I greeted her, trying to look calm, but she just kept staring at my face.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I handed her the manju I'd brought as a gift, she took them quickly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And then...<PG>
"I'll come by later..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
was all she said, and she slammed the door shut.
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ドア激しく閉める.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\ループアパート外廊下.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "300" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was stunned, but I figured Tokyo really did have strange people, and went back to my own room.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\ループアパート部屋3夜.gal" "WAIT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The resident of Room 204 was strange too, but what bothered me more was the inside of that room.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was so dilapidated you'd never think anyone lived there.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The woman was bad enough, but I couldn't stop thinking about the inside of that room.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Besides... 
{PAUSE ""}
there really were almost no residents.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\携帯茅萱切.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "650" "C" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\携帯茅萱入.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Maybe this was a property with a dark history.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Its name was '<STYLE ID="4" RUBY="しりんかん">Shirinkan</STYLE>'.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I searched for it on my phone...<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">No results found for “Shirinkan”.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<BR>
That's strange. Could that happen with a building's name these days?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I decided to look into it a little more tomorrow.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―That night.<PG>
{MESOFF "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\ノック.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\ノック.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\ノック.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I woke to a sound like someone knocking on a door.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What on earth was that sound?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Was the neighbor doing something?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\ノック.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
It wasn't a sound like knocking. It was, unmistakably, the sound of knocking.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\スイッチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\ループアパート部屋3夜.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I turned on the light and looked at the clock. It was 3 in the morning.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Did people come by even at this hour in Tokyo?<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... Coming."</STYLE>
