{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―When I came to, it was already the middle of the night.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd been so exhausted that I must have fallen asleep without realizing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And I was terribly hungry again.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My body was badly weakened, and the room smelled of nothing but nasty mold.<PG>
What time was it?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If it was 3 in the morning, the door might open.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Feeling my way, I put the sign in the box and took hold of the doorknob.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\屋上ドア.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\ループアパート外廊下.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
And the door opened easily.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\bgm_semarikuru.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
I couldn't let this chance slip by!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Middle of the night or not, I couldn't care about that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I would push this onto the me next door.<PG>
Fighting not to collapse, 
{PLAYSND "SE\ノック響く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
I knocked on the next room's door.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The room I'd come out of was 205, and the room I knocked on was 206.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This was the end room.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\ノック響く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
Ngh...! Wake up already, me!
{PAUSE ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\ノック響く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<BR>
That terrible hunger came at me again, as if it would crush me!
{PLAYSND "SE\ドアがちゃがちゃ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hurry... hurry...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I nearly blacked out and slumped against the door, but desperately pulled myself upright.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Then out came someone exactly like yesterday's me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Yes...! Now I'll be saved...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A smile rose up in me for the first time in a long while.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\まんじゅう.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPS>"U-Um...! This is... to thank you...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPN>I pushed the sign at her, almost forcing it into her hands.<PG>
But at that instant, the baton of death passed to the other me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To live, I was trying to kill this person.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She thanked me with a puzzled look, but
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"So <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE> have odd eyes too..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
when she had said that much, I couldn't bear the faint <STYLE ID="12" RUBY="かしゃく">pangs</STYLE> of conscience that welled up in me.<PG>
I tried to run away instead of going back to my room, but I could barely even stand anymore.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At this rate, even if I didn't go back to the room, I would die.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ドア激しく閉める.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,アイテム1,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
With the last of my strength, I went back to my room.<PG>
If this saves me... then that's fine...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I die, then it can't be helped.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPS>I did... all... that... I... could.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\quiet-residential-area1.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "700" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>―From outside, I could hear a faint <STYLE ID="13" RUBY="けんそう">hubbub</STYLE>...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\ループアパート部屋3.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
When I came to, I was lying on the floor of my room, back the way it had been.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I looked at my hands, they weren't thin, and my body felt fine.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was saved...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What on earth had that sign been?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What was... Shirinkan?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Terrified, I moved out of the room right away.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\深淵からの呼び声.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\ループアパート外観.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
After that, I passed in front of Shirinkan just once.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The outside was as old as ever.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But the rooms were renovated, out of keeping with it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And the baton of death.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Shirinkan, where neighbor brings death to neighbor.<PG>
The other me I had given the sign to had no one left to pass it on to.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What became of her?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is she alive, or has she rotted away?<PG>
Is she still searching for food, like a zombie that has lost its mind?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe... 
{PAUSE ""}
even now...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
