{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="14">"Wow... So it's a time-loop story, in a way... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="14">What happened to the </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="14"> in 206...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... It's just a ghost story, after all. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
